<title>FRANCE: France details free-market grain bids.</title>
<headline>France details free-market grain bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- April 10 --		--- April 3 ---</p>
<p>		  Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat   325,500    5.31-11.95	290,500 4.74-14.99</p>
<p> Barley	 269,000   29.50-33.50	135,000   30.74-31.96</p>
<p> Rye	    No bids			  No bids</p>
<p> Durum	  No bids			  No bids</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
